From: well0nez <8986239+well0nez@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: arm64: dts: h713: hy320: the display's mix window

The HY320's display node names 0x058c0000 (and its mirror at +0x1000)
as the AFBD's "mix" window (0339): U-Boot leaves bit 28 set for a clean
logo, the driver clears it while the video plane is on.

diff -ruN a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy320.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy320.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy320.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy320.dts
@@ -126,8 +126,21 @@
  * defaults the driver refused to probe and the wall went black after the
  * logo. These are the words this board's handoff consists of, and the ones
  * the driver puts back when the video plane goes away.
+ *
+ * "mix" is the output's mix word 0x058c0000 and its mirror at 0x058c1000.
+ * This board's LogoRegData.bin leaves bit 28 set - the RGB channel alone -
+ * and U-Boot keeps it for the logo; the driver clears it while the video
+ * plane is on and sets it again after (01.11.2026: cleared under the logo,
+ * the logo stood with trailing copies; set always, the video plane black).
  */
 &display {
+	reg = <0x05600000 0x400>,
+	      <0x05140000 0x1000>,
+	      <0x051c0000 0x200>,
+	      <0x05208000 0x2000>,
+	      <0x0524c000 0x100>,
+	      <0x058c0000 0x1004>;
+	reg-names = "afbd", "route", "lvds", "gamma", "osd", "mix";
 	allwinner,handoff-state = <0x03001901 0x03000200 0x00000000>;
 };
 
